 {#BogavatI ca pAtAle svarge mandAkinI taTA#} <ls>Purāṇam</ls>; <ls>A. Rām. 6. 9. 8</ls>.
.²2 A female snake-demon; <ls>Mb. 1. 171. 38</ls>.
.²3 <ab>N.</ab> of the city of the snake-demons in the lower world; {#AtmatulyabalErguptAM#}
 {#nAgErBogavatImiva#} <ls>Bhāg. 1. 11. 11</ls>.
.²4 The night of the second day of a lunar month.
